hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2707","###\n Al-Hasan ibn Muhammad az-Za'farani narrated to us, saying: Yahya ibn Sulaym at-Ta'ifi narrated to us, saying: Abdullah ibn Uthman ibn Khuthaym narrated to me, on the authority of Abu at-Tufayl, on the authority of Abdullah ibn Abbas (RA), in a lengthy narration, he said: \"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) and his companions performed *Izba' (tucking the lower part of the garment under the ar"
